From 0238f7f89aa208e69216fdc59189305622177115 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: havok2-htwo <havok2-htwo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 20:03:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] engine: solo pipeline review fixes (opt-in
 STRATA_SOLO_PIPELINE=1)

- STRATA_PIPELINE_AUTO=0 also keeps the switch from auto-enabling --pipeline-windows 2
- the boot line names the drafter changes the switch brings to every path (8 rows,
  forcing kernel, greatest stream priority; STRATA_MTP_PRIORITY=0 is the A/B knob)
- a failed per-card pre-check says the reservations and drafter changes stay
- pl_drain returns its error; the solo-pipeline teardown dies with it instead of
  set_pl_mode's "a window is in flight"
- STRATA_SOLO_PIPELINE_LOG=1: one line per solo request, pipelined=0/1 and why

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/program/generate.cpp             | 37 ++++++++++++++++++++++------
 tests/program/solo_pipeline_test.cpp |  1 +
 2 files changed, 31 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/program/generate.cpp b/src/program/generate.cpp
index 79bb4f69..7710b94a 100644
--- a/src/program/generate.cpp
+++ b/src/program/generate.cpp
